<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sitting Bull returns five weeks after intake, with the interpreter. The brace was fitted three weeks ago and he wears it most days; the rocker-sole shoe helps in the house. His pain on walking is 5 of 10, from 7. He has had two of the four physical therapy sessions booked so far: the clinic is an hour&apos;s drive, and on the other two weeks he had no ride. He does the home exercises most days. Naproxen with food has caused no stomach trouble so far. He would like the injection the surgeon described. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pain</td><td>5 of 10 on walking</td></tr><tr><td>Brace</td><td>Fitted three weeks ago; worn most days</td></tr><tr><td>Physical therapy</td><td>Two of four sessions; two missed for lack of a ride</td></tr><tr><td>Function</td><td>Foot and Ankle Ability Measure, daily activities, 64%</td></tr><tr><td>Naproxen</td><td>No stomach symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

